%% Youth Account Management Sequence Diagram (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant UI as Parent Portal UI
    participant API as Youth Account API
    participant Auth as OAuth Auth Service
    participant AccountSvc as Account Service
    participant TransSvc as Transaction Service
    participant PaymentSvc as Payment Service
    participant SettingsDB as Settings DB

    Parent->>UI: Login & Access Dashboard
    UI->>Auth: OAuth 2.0 Authorization
    Auth-->>UI: Access Token
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard
    API->>Auth: Validate Token
    Auth-->>API: Token Valid
    API->>AccountSvc: Get Account Info
    AccountSvc-->>API: Account Info
    API->>TransSvc: Get Recent Transactions
    TransSvc-->>API: Transactions
    API->>SettingsDB: Get Spending Limit
    SettingsDB-->>API: Spending Limit
    API-->>UI: Dashboard Data
    UI-->>Parent: Render Dashboard

    Parent->>UI: Initiate Fund Transfer
    UI->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    API->>Auth: Validate Token
    Auth-->>API: Token Valid
    API->>PaymentSvc: Transfer Funds
    PaymentSvc-->>API: Transfer Status
    API->>AccountSvc: Update Account Balance
    AccountSvc-->>API: Updated Balance
    API->>SettingsDB: Log Transfer (for audit)
    SettingsDB-->>API: Log Ack
    API-->>UI: Transfer Result
    UI-->>Parent: Show Transfer Status

    Parent->>UI: Set Spending Limit
    UI->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    API->>Auth: Validate Token
    Auth-->>API: Token Valid
    API->>SettingsDB: Update Limit
    SettingsDB-->>API: Limit Updated
    API-->>UI: Limit Config Result
    UI-->>Parent: Show Limit Update

    Parent->>UI: View Transactions
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    API->>Auth: Validate Token
    Auth-->>API: Token Valid
    API->>TransSvc: Fetch Transaction History
    TransSvc-->>API: Transaction Data
    API-->>UI: Transaction History
    UI-->>Parent: Show Transaction List
